{"id": "19-1982-2-10", "zh": "5,113. yaja 的 ya 变为 ṭi 与 yī", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1983-2-18", "zh": "在带 k 附加符号的词缀之前，yaja 的 ya 变为 ṭi 与 yī；由于“多样”（bahula）规则的支配，在 ti 等语尾的范围内也是如此：加 kya 并作前同化后，得 ijjati、yijjati，例如“佛陀被我供养”。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-1983-19-25", "zh": "他将供养：yajissati；将被他供养：ijjissate、yijjissate。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1983-26-33", "zh": "他供养了：yajī；被他供养了：ijji、yijji。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1983-34-40", "zh": "他本会供养：yajissā；本会被他供养：ijjissā、yijjissā。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1983-41-47", "zh": "他应当供养：yajeyya；应当被他供养：ijjeyya、yijjeyya。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1983-48-55", "zh": "让他供养：yajatu；让他供养（被动）：ijjatu、yijjatu，等等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1984-2-34", "zh": "vada：说。依“gamavadā”等规则，vada 可选地替换为 vajja；依“ūlasse”规则，la 有时也变为 e，于是得 vajjati、vadeti、vadati，vajjenti、vadenti，等等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1984-35-36", "zh": "在被动语态中——", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1984-37-52", "zh": "依“kyassā”规则加 īña，得 vajjīyati、vajjati、vadīyati，vajjīyanti、vajjanti、vadīyanti。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1984-53-56", "zh": "vadissati，vadissanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1984-57-62", "zh": "avadī、vadī，avadiṃsu、vadiṃsu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1984-63-65", "zh": "avadissa、vadissa。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1984-66-73", "zh": "vajje、vajjeyya、vade、vadeyya，vajjeyyuṃ、vadeyyuṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1984-74-80", "zh": "vajjetu、vadetu、vadatu 等等，应依照经典中的用例来了解。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1985-2-33", "zh": "kamu：迈步。依“parokkhāyañcā”中的 ca 字，kama 重复为 kama kama，删去非首位的辅音，加 la 词缀，依“kavaggahā”等规则把 ka 变为 ca，再加入鼻音（niggahīta），于是得 caṃkamati、kamati，等等。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-1985-34-39", "zh": "cala：摇动，得 caṃcalati。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1985-40-53", "zh": "jala、dala：发光，重复后得 daddallati，等等。（带增音的 bhū 类动词规则）", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-1986-2-30", "zh": "hū、bhū：存在。在 ti 等语尾中，依“kattari lo”规则加 la；删去 la 之后，依“yuvaṇṇāna + meo paccaye”规则变为 o。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1986-31-36", "zh": "他存在：hoti；他们存在：honti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-1986-37-40", "zh": "hosi，hotha。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1986-41-45", "zh": "homi，homa，等等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1986-46-49", "zh": "在无人称语态中：由他存在，hūyati、hūyate。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1987-2-10", "zh": "31. 在 ssati 等之前，hū 变为 he、hehi、hohi", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1988-2-6", "zh": "在 ssati 等之前，hū 变为 he 等形式。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1988-7-11", "zh": "hessati、hehissati、hohissati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-1989-2-11", "zh": "69. 在 dakkha、kha、hehi、hohi 之后删除", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1990-2-10", "zh": "在 dakkha 等替换形之后，后面的 ssa 可选地删除。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1990-11-16", "zh": "hehiti、hehissati，hohiti、hohissati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1990-17-23", "zh": "hehinti、hehissanti，hohinti、hohissanti，等等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1990-24-40", "zh": "在非今日过去时（anajjatana）中，于 ī 之前加 a 增音，依“paro kvacī”规则删去 ī，得 so ahu（他曾存在）。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "19-1990-41-55", "zh": "作增音时，依“dīghā īssa”规则把 ī 替换为 si，例如“当时的鹦鹉就是阿难”（suvo ahosi ānando）。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-1991-2-5", "zh": "41. 在 hū 之后变为 resuṃ", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1992-2-10", "zh": "在 hū 之后，后面的 uṃ 可选地变为 resuṃ。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1992-11-20", "zh": "r 是附加符号，依“rānubandhentasarādissā”规则，删去词干末元音及其后的部分。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-1992-21-22", "zh": "ahesuṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1992-23-26", "zh": "增音为 o，再替换为 av，得 ahavuṃ。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-1992-27-30", "zh": "o 替换为 si，得 ahosi。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-1993-2-6", "zh": "46. iṃ 也变为 siña", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1994-2-7", "zh": "iṃ 变为 siña，mhā 与 ttha 也多样地如此。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-1994-8-15", "zh": "ñ 字表示它是动词的组成部分，i 字是为了便于发音。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-1994-16-27", "zh": "依“aīssā”等规则加 iñ 增音，得 tumhe ahosittha（你们曾存在），ahosi。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-1994-28-38", "zh": "删去后元音并作短音化，得 ahuṃ、ahosimha、ahumha（短音）。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "19-1994-39-44", "zh": "在无人称语态中：abhavi；ā 替换为 ttha，得 abhavittha。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-1994-45-66", "zh": "在非今日过去时中加 ā、ū 等语尾后，依“yuvaṇṇāna + miya ṅuvaṅa sare”规则替换为 uvaṅ，得 ahuvā、ahuvu、ahuvo、ahuvattha。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-1994-67-74", "zh": "a 替换为 aṃ，得 ahuṃ、ahuvaṃ、ahumha，等等。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-1994-75-78", "zh": "在无人称语态中：由他 ahuyi、ahuyittha。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1994-79-83", "zh": "ahavissā，ahavissaṃsu，等等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1994-84-87", "zh": "在无人称语态中：ahuyissa，ahuyissatha。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1994-88-95", "zh": "删去前元音，得 heyya、heyyuṃ，等等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1994-96-99", "zh": "在无人称语态中：hūyeyya、hūyetha。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1994-100-104", "zh": "hotu，hontu，等等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1994-105-108", "zh": "在无人称语态中：hūyatu、hūyataṃ。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1994-109-114", "zh": "加前缀 anu 时，得 anubhoti 等，应在所有时态中照此配合。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1994-115-117", "zh": "因为无人称语态中没有这些词形。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "19-1994-118-121", "zh": "在被动语态中：anubhūyati 等，这是区别所在。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-1995-2-11", "zh": "si：卧。删去 la，作增音，得 seti。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1995-12-18", "zh": "替换为 ay 后得 sayati，senti、sayanti，等等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1995-19-38", "zh": "在被动语态中：带前缀 ati，加 kya，并依“dīgho sarassā”规则把 i 变长后，得 tena atisīyati、atisīyanti，等等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1995-39-43", "zh": "在无人称语态中：由他 sīyati、sīyate。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1995-44-46", "zh": "在 bhavissati 等时态中也是如此。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1996-2-18", "zh": "nī：引导。这是双宾语动词，例如把山羊带到村里：ajaṃ gāmaṃ neti、nayati，nenti、nayanti，等等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1996-19-24", "zh": "在被动语态中：nīyate gāmaṃ ajo devadattena（山羊被提婆达多带到村里），等等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1996-25-28", "zh": "其余时态也应同样配合。", "confidence": 70}
